# GloDroid's init.glodroid.usb.rc sets sys.usb.controller only inside its
# `on charger` block, hardcoded to 11110000.dwc3 (a DesignWare controller from
# another SoC). kiwi's ChipIdea UDC enumerates as ci_hdrc.0 -- confirmed on the
# device via /sys/class/udc -- so on a normal boot the property is empty, the
# gadget HAL has no UDC to bind, nothing enumerates over USB, and Settings
# crashes when it queries the HAL for available configurations.
on early-init
    setprop sys.usb.controller ci_hdrc.0
